sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Client
  participant P1 as Gateway
  participant P2 as Batcher
  participant P3 as Model
  P0->>P1: Versioned bounded input
  P1->>P2: Admit under deadline
  P2->>P3: Compatible bounded batch
  P3->>P2: Model output and timing
  P2->>P1: Per-request result
  P1->>P0: Response with model version
  P0-->>P1: Optional cancellation
